# The URL the collector reaches the broker of the cloud with, password and all.
# Copy this file to tally-collector-amqp.env and put the broker account, its
# password and the broker's host in place of the three placeholders
# (docs/how-to/openstack/connect-the-collector.md, "Create the broker account").
# The broker has to be reachable from the pods of this cluster.
amqp-url=amqp://<user>:<password>@<host>:5672/
